<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>A hint, you say? If I must say something―<PG>
If these are incidents that occurred precisely because the Megasawa City case was averted, does that mean their root cause is, after all, Megasawa City?<PG>
However, either way, tragedy occurred. In other words, we should probably think that the root cause lay even further back than the time when the Megasawa City case occurred.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
